{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 主流框架MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"LlamaIndex的数据处理与RAG能力\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"主流框架\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/主流框架\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"LlamaIndex的数据处理与RAG能力\" dir=\"auto\">LlamaIndex的数据处理与RAG能力</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细说明LlamaIndex的技术架构，包括数据连接器、索引构建、查询引擎三大核心模块，以及它在RAG系统中的定位和优势。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>LlamaIndex的技术架构</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">LlamaIndex（现更名为LlamaIndex Core）是一个专注于<strong>数据处理和检索增强</strong>的框架，其核心目标是将私有数据转化为LLM可用的知识。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>四大核心模块：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>数据输入层（Data Connectors）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">从多种数据源导入内容：PDF、Word、Markdown、数据库、API、云存储等</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">支持50+种数据加载器</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>数据处理与索引层（Data Processing &amp; Indexing）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Node Parser</strong>：文档切分为文本块（Chunks）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Embedding Model</strong>：文本向量化</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Index</strong>：多种索引结构\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">VectorStoreIndex</code>：基于向量相似度的索引（最常用）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">TreeIndex</code>：树状结构索引，适合层次化查询</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">KeywordTableIndex</code>：关键词索引</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">KnowledgeGraphIndex</code>：知识图谱索引</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>查询引擎层（Query Engine）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">Retriever</code>：检索器，负责从索引中获取相关文档</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">Response Synthesizer</code>：响应合成器，将检索结果和查询组合生成答案</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">支持多种检索策略：相似度检索、混合检索、多跳检索</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>应用层集成（Application Integration）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">与LangChain、OpenAI、HuggingFace等框架无缝集成</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>LlamaIndex在RAG系统中的角色：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">RAG系统架构（LlamaIndex视角）\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│           查询引擎 (Query Engine)          │\n│    Retriever → Postprocessor → Synthesis  │\n└──────────────────┬───────────────────────┘\n                   │ 检索Top-K\n┌──────────────────▼───────────────────────┐\n│           索引层 (Index)                  │\n│    VectorStore / Tree / KeywordTable      │\n└──────────────────┬───────────────────────┘\n                   │ 向量相似度/关键词匹配\n┌──────────────────▼───────────────────────┐\n│        数据加载层 (Data Connectors)        │\n│    PDF / DB / API / Markdown / ...        │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示例：完整RAG流程</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> llama_index<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>core <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> VectorStoreIndex<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> SimpleDirectoryReader<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Settings\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> llama_index<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>core<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>retrievers <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> VectorIndexRetriever\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> llama_index<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>core<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>query_engine <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> RetrieverQueryEngine\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> llama_index<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llms<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>openai <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> OpenAI\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> llama_index<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>openai <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> OpenAIEmbedding\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 配置模型</span>\nSettings<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> OpenAI<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nSettings<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embed_model <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> OpenAIEmbedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"text-embedding-3-small\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 数据加载</span>\ndocuments <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> SimpleDirectoryReader<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"./data\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>load_data<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 构建向量索引（自动完成：切分→Embedding→存储）</span>\nindex <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> VectorStoreIndex<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>from_documents<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>documents<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 配置检索器</span>\nretriever <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> VectorIndexRetriever<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    index<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>index<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    similarity_top_k<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 返回Top-5相关文档</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 5. 创建查询引擎</span>\nquery_engine <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> RetrieverQueryEngine<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>retriever<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>retriever<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 6. 查询</span>\nresponse <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> query_engine<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"LlamaIndex的核心优势是什么？\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>response<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 高级：自定义节点处理器</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> llama_index<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>core<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>node_parser <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> SentenceWindowNodeParser\n\nnode_parser <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> SentenceWindowNodeParser<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>from_defaults<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    window_size<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    include_metadata<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nindex <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> VectorStoreIndex<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>from_documents<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    documents<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    transformations<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>node_parser<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：LlamaIndex的索引类型有哪些？各自适用什么场景？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">VectorStoreIndex</code>适合语义检索（最通用）；<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">TreeIndex</code>适合层次化总结；<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">KeywordTableIndex</code>适合精确关键词匹配；<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">KnowledgeGraphIndex</code>适合关系型知识查询；<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">ComposableGraph</code>支持多索引组合。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：LlamaIndex与LangChain的RAG实现有什么区别？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：LlamaIndex更专注于数据侧的优化（多种索引、高级检索策略、自动数据优化），LangChain更侧重于链式编排的灵活性。生产环境中常将LlamaIndex作为Retriever嵌入LangChain/LangGraph的工作流中。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：LlamaIndex只能做RAG。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：LlamaIndex的能力不仅限于RAG，还包括数据代理（Data Agent）、工具使用、工作流编排等。其Agents可以自主决定如何与数据交互。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}